#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:5
msgid "PRAMIN aperture mechanism"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:8
msgid ""
"The following description is approximate and current as of the Ampere "
"family. It may change for future generations and is intended to assist in "
"understanding the driver code."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:13
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:15
msgid ""
"PRAMIN is a hardware aperture mechanism that provides CPU access to GPU "
"Video RAM (VRAM) before the GPU's Memory Management Unit (MMU) and page "
"tables are initialized. This 1 MiB sliding window, located at a fixed offset "
"within BAR0, is essential for setting up page tables and other critical GPU "
"data structures without relying on the GPU's MMU."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:22
msgid "Architecture Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:24
msgid ""
"The PRAMIN aperture mechanism is logically implemented by the GPU's PBUS "
"(PCIe Bus Controller Unit) and provides a CPU-accessible window into VRAM "
"through the PCIe interface::"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:57
msgid ""
"PBUS is responsible for, among other things, handling MMIO accesses to the "
"BAR registers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:61
msgid "PRAMIN Window Operation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:63
msgid ""
"The PRAMIN window provides a 1 MiB sliding aperture that can be repositioned "
"over the entire VRAM address space using the ``NV_PBUS_BAR0_WINDOW`` "
"register."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:67
msgid "Window Control Mechanism"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:88
msgid ""
"Nova only uses TARGET=VRAM (0x0) for video memory access. The SYS_MEM target "
"values are documented here for hardware completeness but are not used by the "
"driver."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:93
msgid "64 KiB Alignment Requirement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../gpu/nova/core/pramin.rst:95
msgid ""
"The PRAMIN window must be aligned to 64 KiB boundaries in VRAM. This is "
"enforced by the ``BASE_ADDR`` field representing bits [39:16] of the target "
"address::"
msgstr ""
